WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:30.296
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:30.566 --> 01:31.551
=Tigers Sniff the Rose=

3
01:31.551 --> 01:33.560
(Based on the novel of the same name by Yiren Kuikui)

4
01:35.070 --> 01:38.900
=Episode 1=

5
01:48.140 --> 01:49.660
(Huai Dynasty, Yingxiang 21, Spring) (In the 21st year of Yingxiang,)

6
01:50.500 --> 01:52.140
(Princess Danyang, Mu Wanyao,)

7
01:52.580 --> 01:53.900
(visited Mount Lufu to honor her late mother.)

8
01:53.900 --> 01:54.820
(Caimei Ridge, Lingnan Circuit)

9
01:54.820 --> 01:55.220
(On her way back,)

10
01:55.980 --> 01:58.220
(she passed through Caimei Ridge in Lingnan Circuit.)

11
02:02.740 --> 02:03.420
(Something's wrong! Something's wrong!)

12
02:04.100 --> 02:04.500
(Somebody, help!)

13
02:04.700 --> 02:05.300
(A wheel spoke has snapped!)

14
02:05.300 --> 02:06.140
(This road is terrible!)

15
02:06.220 --> 02:07.020
(Grab a wooden pole to prop it up!)

16
02:07.340 --> 02:07.900
(Coming!)

17
02:09.540 --> 02:11.700
My lady, one of the carriage's wheel spokes has broken.

18
02:20.300 --> 02:22.740
(Mu Wanyao, Princess Danyang)

19
02:22.740 --> 02:23.620
What a wretched place!

20
02:25.340 --> 02:29.500
(Chunhua, Princess Danyang's Maid)

21
02:29.580 --> 02:30.060
My lady.

22
02:31.060 --> 02:32.580
Do you think there really are tigers in these mountains?

23
02:34.220 --> 02:35.340
This is Lingnan,

24
02:35.500 --> 02:36.380
not Sheng'an.

25
02:37.060 --> 02:37.820
Forget tigers and leopards.

26
02:38.460 --> 02:39.860
Even spirits and monsters

27
02:40.180 --> 02:41.180
wouldn't be surprising here.

28
02:43.140 --> 02:43.660
My lady.

29
02:44.420 --> 02:45.460
The carriage has a broken wheel spoke.

30
02:45.660 --> 02:46.700
It'll take two hours to replace.

31
02:47.460 --> 02:48.420
(Fang Tong, Princess Danyang's Guard) We're still far from the relay station.

32
02:48.740 --> 02:50.180
We can either risk pressing on after dark

33
02:50.500 --> 02:51.540
or spend the night here.

34
02:52.140 --> 02:52.820
What would you prefer?

35
03:44.020 --> 03:44.500
My lady!

36
03:45.260 --> 03:45.940
There really are monsters here!

37
04:37.060 --> 04:40.540
♪Moonlight shimmers upon the pond♪

38
04:41.140 --> 04:44.660
♪Riding a bamboo horse past the red pond♪

39
04:45.060 --> 04:48.540
♪The water's too deep to cross♪

40
04:48.940 --> 04:52.460
♪A maiden rows to fetch her love♪

41
04:52.940 --> 04:56.420
♪She asks her sweetheart this and that♪

42
04:56.820 --> 05:00.340
♪When you leave again, when will you be back?♪

43
05:04.940 --> 05:05.780
You insolent rogue!

44
05:06.180 --> 05:07.420
What are you staring at my lady for?

45
05:11.980 --> 05:13.260
Are you heading across Caimei Ridge, my lady?

46
05:13.940 --> 05:14.620
What's it to you?

47
05:20.260 --> 05:21.300
Another five li ahead,

48
05:21.820 --> 05:22.420
you'll reach the official road.

49
05:23.100 --> 05:24.180
Follow it east,

50
05:24.460 --> 05:25.300
and you'll find a relay station.

51
05:26.820 --> 05:28.060
Did anyone ask you for directions?

52
05:29.220 --> 05:30.020
Besides,

53
05:30.740 --> 05:32.300
how do I know you're not just making it up?

54
05:34.740 --> 05:35.460
You have a point, my lady.

55
05:35.980 --> 05:37.020
You can never be too careful.

56
05:37.780 --> 05:38.220
I'll be off, then.

57
05:39.100 --> 05:39.620
Stop right there.

58
05:51.700 --> 05:52.500
Where are you going?

59
05:53.140 --> 05:53.700
Home.

60
05:55.900 --> 05:57.260
No luggage,

61
05:57.540 --> 05:58.420
and traveling on foot at dusk.

62
05:59.060 --> 05:59.780
Your home

63
06:00.260 --> 06:01.260
must be somewhere in these mountains.

64
06:03.540 --> 06:03.860
It is.

65
06:05.780 --> 06:06.660
Then lead the way.

66
06:08.340 --> 06:09.220
Wonderful, my lady!

67
06:09.780 --> 06:11.220
We won't have to sleep out in the wilderness tonight!

68
06:13.260 --> 06:13.580
Well...

69
06:14.860 --> 06:15.620
My home is rather small.

70
06:15.940 --> 06:17.020
I'm afraid there isn't room for so many guests.

71
06:20.260 --> 06:21.260
You sure talk too much.

72
06:26.140 --> 06:27.500
You're not afraid I might be a liar anymore?

73
06:29.540 --> 06:30.380
With that build of yours,

74
06:30.860 --> 06:31.940
even if you meant me harm,

75
06:32.300 --> 06:33.180
who could you possibly hurt?

76
06:54.820 --> 06:55.980
You're a strange one.

77
06:56.660 --> 06:57.620
It's not even dark yet.

78
06:58.580 --> 06:59.900
Why have you lit a torch already?

79
07:01.220 --> 07:02.060
These woods are remote,

80
07:02.460 --> 07:03.300
and we often run into wild animals.

81
07:03.660 --> 07:05.140
Even by day, we carry torches when we travel through the mountains.

82
07:06.020 --> 07:07.460
You're a traveler from elsewhere, aren't you, my lady?

83
07:09.860 --> 07:10.740
What's your name?

84
07:11.420 --> 07:11.980
My surname is Yan.

85
07:12.540 --> 07:13.380
I'm the second child in my family.

86
07:17.260 --> 07:17.860
Yan Shang.

87
07:18.820 --> 07:20.220
Who else lives with you?

88
07:21.380 --> 07:22.460
(Yan Shang) My elderly father,

89
07:22.860 --> 07:23.540
an older brother, and a younger sister.

90
07:24.420 --> 07:25.380
And what should I call you, my lady?

91
07:26.300 --> 07:28.300
There isn't a village or inn in these mountains.

92
07:28.980 --> 07:30.580
Why is yours the only family living out here?

93
07:31.980 --> 07:32.980
Are you refugees

94
07:33.260 --> 07:34.140
or outlaws?

95
07:35.500 --> 07:36.180
To tell you the truth, my lady,

96
07:36.780 --> 07:37.620
when I first saw you,

97
07:38.060 --> 07:39.500
surrounded by attendants in the middle of nowhere,

98
07:39.940 --> 07:40.660
a beautiful lady traveling alone,

99
07:41.500 --> 07:42.980
I thought you might be a fox spirit or a seductive ghost.

100
07:48.660 --> 07:50.420
(What a temper this lady has.)

101
08:00.300 --> 08:00.740
My lady.

102
08:01.220 --> 08:01.980
My home is rather humble.

103
08:02.900 --> 08:03.940
Are you sure you want to stay?

104
08:09.620 --> 08:10.180
Guards!

105
08:12.780 --> 08:13.700
Clear out

106
08:14.260 --> 08:14.860
these two rooms.

107
08:15.180 --> 08:15.620
I'll be using them.

108
08:15.740 --> 08:16.540
Yes, my lady!

109
08:18.660 --> 08:18.980
(Over here!)

110
08:18.980 --> 08:19.820
- (Here!) - (Check over here!)

111
08:19.820 --> 08:20.260
(Tear this place down!)

112
08:20.260 --> 08:20.980
(Replace that stool!)

113
08:21.700 --> 08:24.500
♪Dark clouds gather, rain's on its way♪

114
08:24.500 --> 08:26.100
(Move aside! Make way! Clear the path!)

115
08:26.340 --> 08:26.740
(Hurry up!)

116
08:27.340 --> 08:28.100
(Move it! Faster!)

117
08:28.980 --> 08:29.340
(Got it!)

118
08:32.460 --> 08:33.740
Who are you people?

119
08:33.860 --> 08:35.100
Where are you taking me?

120
08:35.900 --> 08:36.900
There's a young lady here too?

121
08:38.140 --> 08:39.420
What's so strange about that?

122
08:39.420 --> 08:42.900
♪Oh, what a funny sight♪

123
08:43.460 --> 08:44.180
My wine!

124
08:44.700 --> 08:46.380
My wine!

125
08:47.540 --> 08:50.420
♪Grandma wants it bland♪

126
08:51.020 --> 08:51.380
Father!

127
08:51.380 --> 08:52.260
Shang! Shang! Quick!

128
08:52.260 --> 08:52.580
Father!

129
08:52.740 --> 08:54.060
- Throw them out! - Father! Father!

130
08:54.340 --> 08:55.500
There's more wine! There's more wine!

131
08:57.020 --> 08:57.580
Come on, get up!

132
08:57.940 --> 08:58.300
Father!

133
09:00.140 --> 09:00.540
Father!

134
09:01.340 --> 09:01.660
Father!

135
09:02.220 --> 09:02.980
Shang!

136
09:02.980 --> 09:04.580
♪Clang-a-lang♪

137
09:04.580 --> 09:07.140
(Yan Zhanzhi, Yan Shang's Father)

138
09:07.140 --> 09:08.700
My wine!

139
09:08.700 --> 09:09.060
Father!

140
09:09.660 --> 09:10.020
Father!

141
09:10.380 --> 09:10.900
Please, get up!

142
09:12.020 --> 09:13.460
Shang!

143
09:15.340 --> 09:16.180
I'll explain everything later.

144
09:16.180 --> 09:16.660
My wine!

145
09:16.660 --> 09:18.060
Father, there'll be more wine.

146
09:18.340 --> 09:19.100
Just sit inside.

147
09:19.260 --> 09:19.780
I'll handle this.

148
09:20.180 --> 09:23.180
♪Grandpa digs up a loach♪

149
09:23.460 --> 09:27.500
♪Oh, what a funny sight♪

150
09:27.500 --> 09:29.500
Shang!

151
09:29.900 --> 09:32.700
♪Grandpa wants it salty♪

152
09:33.100 --> 09:35.940
♪Grandma wants it bland♪

153
09:36.420 --> 09:40.980
♪They start a fight and smash the pot♪

154
09:42.980 --> 09:44.460
♪Yi-ya-ha-do♪

155
09:44.580 --> 09:47.580
♪Clang-a-lang, clang-a-lang♪ (Yan Dalang, Yan Shang's Older Brother)

156
09:47.580 --> 09:48.220
Shang!

157
09:48.380 --> 09:48.980
Father!

158
09:49.220 --> 09:49.820
Run!

159
09:50.060 --> 09:50.700
Run, Shang!

160
09:50.700 --> 09:51.140
Brother!

161
09:51.180 --> 09:51.980
(Yan Xiaozhou, Yan Shang's Sister) Father, run!

162
09:52.060 --> 09:53.020
- Brother! - Bandits are in our house!

163
09:53.020 --> 09:53.900
Let go of my brother!

164
09:53.900 --> 09:54.220
Move!

165
09:54.220 --> 09:55.420
Shang, run!

166
09:55.780 --> 09:57.100
Xiaozhou, run!

167
09:57.100 --> 09:57.580
Let him go!

168
09:57.580 --> 09:57.980
Out of the way!

169
10:00.100 --> 10:01.180
Who are you calling a bandit?

170
10:02.500 --> 10:03.540
There's a woman bandit too!

171
10:03.780 --> 10:04.980
Xiaozhou, run!

172
10:05.500 --> 10:06.100
Run!

173
10:06.780 --> 10:07.740
Brother! Brother!

174
10:08.100 --> 10:08.780
She's not a bandit.

175
10:08.980 --> 10:09.500
There are no bandits.

176
10:09.980 --> 10:10.540
Father's fine.

177
10:10.860 --> 10:11.540
We're all fine.

178
10:12.300 --> 10:12.660
It's okay.

179
10:12.780 --> 10:13.340
Yan Shang.

180
10:14.300 --> 10:15.220
Does no one in your family

181
10:15.780 --> 10:17.900
know how to treat people properly?

182
10:18.620 --> 10:20.260
Is there no law in this world?

183
10:20.260 --> 10:20.580
Father!

184
10:20.820 --> 10:21.460
Father!

185
10:22.260 --> 10:22.620
Father!

186
10:23.060 --> 10:24.060
I am the law.

187
10:36.820 --> 10:37.260
My lady.

188
10:37.740 --> 10:38.940
My brother has a mental disability.

189
10:39.180 --> 10:39.820
He meant no offense.

190
10:40.580 --> 10:41.540
Could you please have mercy on him?

191
10:42.180 --> 10:43.340
For a country bumpkin,

192
10:43.740 --> 10:44.780
you know what's good for you.

193
10:48.860 --> 10:50.500
- Shang is no country bumpkin! - Brother!

194
10:51.100 --> 10:52.220
- He's not a bumpkin! - Brother!

195
10:52.340 --> 10:52.620
Brother!

196
10:52.660 --> 10:53.020
Brother!

197
10:53.860 --> 10:54.820
Stop it. Don't say another word!

198
10:54.940 --> 10:55.980
- This is our house! - Brother!

199
10:56.020 --> 10:56.340
Brother!

200
10:56.340 --> 10:56.980
Let me go!

201
10:56.980 --> 10:57.420
All right, all right.

202
10:57.860 --> 10:58.580
He's not a bumpkin!

203
10:58.580 --> 10:59.780
- Brother! - Go get changed.

204
10:59.780 --> 11:00.460
This is our house!

205
11:00.460 --> 11:01.100
- Brother! - I'll keep an eye on him.

206
11:01.300 --> 11:02.460
He's no country bumpkin!

207
11:02.660 --> 11:03.740
I'll throw them all out!

208
11:03.740 --> 11:04.780
Shang?

209
11:04.780 --> 11:05.780
Let me go!

210
11:07.780 --> 11:08.620
His name is Yan Shang.

211
11:10.620 --> 11:11.620
I was only trying to help with directions.

212
11:12.340 --> 11:14.260
But they immediately ordered me to lead them back to my house.

213
11:16.540 --> 11:17.620
I take that road every day.

214
11:18.300 --> 11:19.740
Never thought it'd bring so much trouble to our door.

215
11:20.220 --> 11:21.380
It's not your fault, brother.

216
11:21.740 --> 11:22.660
If I'd run into her,

217
11:22.780 --> 11:23.980
I'd have let her stay too.

218
11:24.900 --> 11:26.300
That woman is clearly used to getting her way.

219
11:27.260 --> 11:28.660
She must be from some prominent household.

220
11:32.260 --> 11:33.420
Let's just hope they stay one night

221
11:33.940 --> 11:34.620
and leave first thing tomorrow.

222
11:37.940 --> 11:40.500
Brother, please don't argue with them again.

223
11:40.740 --> 11:42.180
Just listen to Shang, all right?

224
11:44.620 --> 11:45.140
(You lot,)

225
11:45.500 --> 11:46.780
(go get some proper tools!)

226
11:46.980 --> 11:48.020
(Bring a horse over to help pull!)

227
11:51.740 --> 11:52.140
Brother!

228
11:52.860 --> 11:53.220
Brother!

229
11:53.820 --> 11:54.260
Brother!

230
11:55.100 --> 11:55.500
Brother!

231
11:56.340 --> 11:56.780
You can't tear it down!

232
11:57.260 --> 11:57.860
What are you doing?

233
11:58.380 --> 11:59.300
This is my house!

234
11:59.660 --> 12:01.100
Your house is tiny and stuffy.

235
12:01.220 --> 12:02.260
We'll suffocate in this heat!

236
12:02.740 --> 12:03.740
- Widen the doorway, - No!

237
12:03.780 --> 12:04.380
knock down that wall,

238
12:04.380 --> 12:05.460
- and we can finally catch a breeze. - Don't touch anything!

239
12:08.100 --> 12:10.300
We worked ourselves to the bone building this house.

240
12:11.460 --> 12:11.900
Don't worry.

241
12:15.100 --> 12:15.660
This money

242
12:15.940 --> 12:17.540
could build you eight or ten houses.

243
12:20.300 --> 12:20.900
Carry on.

244
12:21.580 --> 12:22.700
Don't touch my door!

245
12:23.020 --> 12:24.940
Don't tear it down! Don't! Don't!

246
12:25.420 --> 12:26.300
You bunch of bandits!

247
12:26.660 --> 12:27.180
Stop it!

248
12:27.540 --> 12:28.900
I'll fight you if you touch it!

249
12:29.380 --> 12:29.780
Hands off!

250
12:32.220 --> 12:33.340
So it's the heat that's troubling you, my lady.

251
12:33.940 --> 12:35.140
We haven't been good hosts.

252
12:35.820 --> 12:37.460
But this house is badly in need of repair.

253
12:37.940 --> 12:38.780
If you tear down a wall,

254
12:38.980 --> 12:39.780
it may not be safe to stay here.

255
12:40.140 --> 12:41.620
Wouldn't it be even better if the house collapsed?

256
12:42.660 --> 12:44.900
If it crushed the wicked woman like me, who took over your house,

257
12:45.500 --> 12:46.740
you'd be thrilled, wouldn't you?

258
12:47.300 --> 12:47.940
You're our guest.

259
12:48.300 --> 12:49.460
If you don't mind our humble home,

260
12:49.780 --> 12:50.820
we'll do our best to treat you well.

261
12:51.420 --> 12:51.940
Treat me well?

262
12:54.500 --> 12:54.860
Fine.

263
12:55.660 --> 12:56.300
I want some wine.

264
12:56.900 --> 12:57.700
And make sure it's chilled.

265
12:57.940 --> 12:58.620
Lots of ice.

266
12:59.940 --> 13:00.940
But you're a woman.

267
13:01.100 --> 13:02.340
Women can drink too?

268
13:03.540 --> 13:03.900
Brother!

269
13:04.460 --> 13:04.860
What?

270
13:05.540 --> 13:06.380
Is it against the law

271
13:06.980 --> 13:08.340
for a woman to drink?

272
13:16.060 --> 13:16.660
Just a moment, my lady.

273
13:18.340 --> 13:18.620
Here.

274
13:21.140 --> 13:21.620
Brother.

275
13:22.660 --> 13:23.140
Brother.

276
13:23.620 --> 13:25.340
There are still a few jars of your lychee wine left.

277
13:25.700 --> 13:27.220
But I don't know where to get any ice.

278
13:27.220 --> 13:28.300
We can't worry about that right now.

279
13:28.660 --> 13:30.660
She's just tired and irritable from the journey.

280
13:30.940 --> 13:31.900
She's taking it out on our house.

281
13:32.260 --> 13:32.860
So what do we do?

282
13:35.420 --> 13:35.980
I'll fetch the wine.

283
14:00.300 --> 14:01.740
Is that idiot still standing by the door?

284
14:02.220 --> 14:03.580
Still guarding his precious wall.

285
14:03.700 --> 14:04.660
He's terrified we'll tear it down.

286
14:05.340 --> 14:07.060
Those Yan brothers are quite a pair.

287
14:07.580 --> 14:08.740
Yan Dalang is dumb as an ox.

288
14:09.180 --> 14:09.700
Yan Shang

289
14:10.220 --> 14:11.580
is as timid as a rabbit.

290
14:14.740 --> 14:15.140
My lady.

291
14:15.580 --> 14:17.340
Yan Shang has brought some wine to cool you down.

292
14:20.660 --> 14:21.540
He actually found some ice?

293
14:27.860 --> 14:28.340
Where's the ice?

294
14:30.260 --> 14:31.060
You've come a long way, my lady.

295
14:31.660 --> 14:32.740
You must be tired.

296
14:34.140 --> 14:35.460
This is our homemade fruit wine.

297
14:36.140 --> 14:37.740
Chilled in water till it's cold as ice.

298
14:38.380 --> 14:39.780
Just right to cool you down and refresh you.

299
14:41.500 --> 14:42.660
Cold as ice?

300
14:43.380 --> 14:44.340
But it's still not ice.

301
14:45.980 --> 14:46.660
Besides,

302
14:46.900 --> 14:49.020
I've tasted dozens of fine wines in Sheng'an,

303
14:49.740 --> 14:51.780
even a few imported grape wines.

304
14:52.860 --> 14:54.100
What could your homemade country wine

305
14:54.660 --> 14:55.740
possibly have to offer?

306
14:58.220 --> 14:59.500
This wine is called Lingxi.

307
15:00.260 --> 15:02.860
Legend has it that a white rhinoceros dug the ground here with its horn,

308
15:03.260 --> 15:04.100
and a spring burst forth.

309
15:04.620 --> 15:06.380
From the spring grew a lychee tree,

310
15:06.980 --> 15:08.540
bearing exquisite blossoms and fragrant fruit.

311
15:12.060 --> 15:15.060
This wine is made from the fruit of that very tree.

312
15:15.740 --> 15:16.860
Why not give it a try, my lady?

313
15:17.860 --> 15:18.300
It's a shame

314
15:18.740 --> 15:19.860
you've come at the wrong time of year.

315
15:20.260 --> 15:20.940
If you wait until summer,

316
15:21.340 --> 15:22.780
you can taste fresh lychees too.

317
15:24.500 --> 15:26.700
Yan Shang, you certainly know how to spin a tale.

318
15:28.700 --> 15:29.300
Pour it.

319
15:52.540 --> 15:53.860
You're quite the smooth talker, Shang.

320
15:54.540 --> 15:56.340
Why don't you have the first cup?

321
16:01.340 --> 16:02.100
Truth be told, my lady,

322
16:02.620 --> 16:03.860
I can't hold my liquor.

323
16:05.100 --> 16:05.980
Even the smell makes me tipsy.

324
16:06.580 --> 16:07.100
I'm afraid

325
16:07.780 --> 16:09.020
I'd only spoil your enjoyment.

326
16:09.900 --> 16:11.620
People who claim they can't hold their liquor

327
16:12.060 --> 16:13.180
usually drink like fish.

328
16:14.300 --> 16:15.500
Now that you've said that,

329
16:16.980 --> 16:18.180
there's no way I'm letting you off.

330
16:20.100 --> 16:21.100
Will you drink it yourself,

331
16:21.980 --> 16:22.980
or shall I have someone pour it down your throat?

332
16:23.420 --> 16:24.940
Who knows where this wine of yours came from?

333
16:25.020 --> 16:26.060
And you expect my lady to drink it?

334
16:26.620 --> 16:27.900
What if you've poisoned it?

335
16:29.460 --> 16:30.500
If they managed to poison me,

336
16:31.060 --> 16:32.380
their whole family would celebrate.

337
16:33.980 --> 16:34.580
Yan Shang.

338
16:35.260 --> 16:36.300
I don't think your wine

339
16:36.860 --> 16:37.980
will cool me down.

340
16:38.820 --> 16:40.540
It's only making my blood boil.

341
16:53.580 --> 16:55.900
You really do ask the impossible, my lady.

342
17:32.260 --> 17:32.940
Impressive drinking!

343
17:39.460 --> 17:41.380
My lady! The wine's poisoned!

344
17:54.020 --> 17:54.940
He actually passed out drunk?

345
18:02.260 --> 18:03.100
Who would've thought?

346
18:03.740 --> 18:05.340
So that was one thing he wasn't lying about.

347
19:14.220 --> 19:14.700
Chunhua!

348
19:20.020 --> 19:21.660
Since when do geckos make noise?

349
19:58.660 --> 19:59.820
(The moon here in Lingnan)

350
20:00.540 --> 20:02.860
(seems so much clearer than in Sheng'an.)

351
20:04.300 --> 20:05.620
(If one could live like the Yan family,)

352
20:06.820 --> 20:08.220
(all together in the mountains,)

353
20:09.060 --> 20:09.900
(looking after one another,)

354
20:10.700 --> 20:11.580
(content with simple food and drink...)

355
20:13.500 --> 20:14.180
(Perhaps)

356
20:15.420 --> 20:17.020
(that's a rare blessing in this world.)

357
20:33.340 --> 20:36.060
(Yi Zhi consulted...)

358
20:46.540 --> 20:47.580
It's the middle of the night.

359
20:47.940 --> 20:48.660
What are you doing?

360
20:50.700 --> 20:51.540
It's already the fourth watch.

361
20:52.100 --> 20:53.140
Why are you still awake, my lady?

362
20:53.500 --> 20:54.500
Your house is crawling with bugs!

363
20:56.580 --> 20:58.820
Living in the mountains means sharing your home with bugs and snakes.

364
20:59.740 --> 21:00.740
But it's not all bad.

365
21:03.100 --> 21:03.420
Look.

366
21:05.580 --> 21:06.260
Fireflies.

367
21:07.580 --> 21:08.460
Can you really see by that light?

368
21:09.300 --> 21:10.140
With these fireflies,

369
21:10.460 --> 21:11.380
I save quite a bit on lamp oil.

370
21:12.140 --> 21:13.380
I just have to catch new ones often and replace them as needed,

371
21:14.180 --> 21:15.140
so they don't die trapped inside.

372
21:19.780 --> 21:22.180
(Yi Zhi consulted with Wu Xian.)

373
21:22.420 --> 21:23.260
You can read?

374
21:24.820 --> 21:25.540
What's that you're writing?

375
21:26.180 --> 21:26.860
I'm copying a book.

376
21:27.980 --> 21:28.740
Where's the book?

377
21:29.260 --> 21:29.780
I've memorized it.

378
21:44.140 --> 21:45.060
My hand's getting sore.

379
21:48.980 --> 21:49.460
Thank you.

380
22:13.180 --> 22:14.060
When I was little,

381
22:14.940 --> 22:16.740
my mother often took me out to catch fireflies.

382
22:20.580 --> 22:21.820
There are fireflies in Sheng'an too?

383
22:22.860 --> 22:23.540
Of course.

384
22:30.940 --> 22:31.940
You're so far from home, my lady.

385
22:32.420 --> 22:33.300
Your mother must be worried.

386
22:34.020 --> 22:34.540
Perhaps you should

387
22:34.980 --> 22:35.940
- head home soon... - That's none of your business!

388
22:45.740 --> 22:46.900
If you want to stay out here and enjoy the cool air,

389
22:47.980 --> 22:48.620
take this

390
22:49.380 --> 22:50.140
to keep mosquitoes and other bugs away.

391
23:03.460 --> 23:05.220
Why are the mosquitoes biting me and not you?

392
23:06.340 --> 23:07.260
Probably because

393
23:07.900 --> 23:09.100
you haven't burned any herbal incense.

394
23:09.860 --> 23:11.580
I've been burning storax incense in my room.

395
23:12.420 --> 23:13.620
I even hung up mosquito-repellent sachets.

396
23:14.180 --> 23:16.620
Those won't work against Lingnan's venomous insects.

397
23:17.260 --> 23:19.300
You need a slow-burning cord made from herbs you prepare yourself.

398
23:19.740 --> 23:20.660
Light one before bed.

399
23:21.100 --> 23:22.100
Then why wasn't there one in my room?

400
23:24.740 --> 23:25.940
Your attendants

401
23:26.500 --> 23:27.140
threw them all out.

402
23:40.340 --> 23:40.820
Don't scratch it.

403
23:42.380 --> 23:43.020
What is it?

404
23:52.780 --> 23:53.500
You've got a bug bite

405
23:54.340 --> 23:55.180
on your face.

406
24:00.860 --> 24:02.180
Try putting some of this herbal balm on it.

407
24:02.660 --> 24:03.340
The swelling should go down soon.

408
24:12.300 --> 24:13.180
It does smell a little unpleasant,

409
24:13.660 --> 24:14.180
but give it a try.

410
24:21.740 --> 24:22.300
A little to the left.

411
24:24.780 --> 24:25.100
To the right.

412
24:26.860 --> 24:27.220
Left.

413
24:28.140 --> 24:28.660
Up a little, to the left.

414
24:28.860 --> 24:29.620
I can't see it!

415
24:29.900 --> 24:30.260
You do it.

416
24:30.580 --> 24:30.860
Here.

417
24:31.500 --> 24:31.860
Hurry up.

418
25:13.020 --> 25:13.700
Th-there.

419
25:30.460 --> 25:31.180
What are you laughing at?

420
25:32.700 --> 25:33.220
Nothing.

421
25:34.700 --> 25:35.220
My face

422
25:35.540 --> 25:36.860
must look ridiculous after you put that on!

423
25:37.420 --> 25:37.820
No.

424
25:38.580 --> 25:38.900
Not at all.

425
25:39.500 --> 25:40.380
Yan Shang!

426
25:40.900 --> 25:41.740
How dare you make fun of me!

427
25:42.300 --> 25:42.620
I...

428
25:46.460 --> 25:48.180
(Yi Zhi consulted with Wu Xian.)

429
25:49.940 --> 25:51.700
That rain came out of nowhere.

430
25:53.500 --> 25:55.180
The rain here never gives you any warning.

431
26:04.020 --> 26:04.900
You should get out of the rain, my lady.

432
26:38.020 --> 26:40.940
(Duke of Zhao's Residence)

433
28:35.420 --> 28:36.740
Another sleepless night, my lady?

434
28:37.940 --> 28:38.620
I want to wash up and get dressed.

435
28:40.340 --> 28:41.020
Just a moment, my lady.

436
28:41.340 --> 28:42.180
I'll get everything ready.

437
29:03.420 --> 29:04.060
Everything's ready, my lady.

438
29:07.820 --> 29:08.420
(What's going on?)

439
29:08.900 --> 29:10.140
(Why is everything wet?)

440
29:12.060 --> 29:13.220
My lady, I'll go take a look.

441
29:20.020 --> 29:20.500
My lady!

442
29:20.660 --> 29:21.140
My lady!

443
29:21.780 --> 29:22.260
My lady!

444
29:22.860 --> 29:24.940
Somehow, your chest of cosmetics got wet in the rain!

445
29:26.780 --> 29:28.580
(It's all because your roof leaked in the middle of the night!)

446
29:30.060 --> 29:31.060
(You're just trying to bully us!)

447
30:02.220 --> 30:04.700
My lady, the Yan family's roof was leaking!

448
30:05.020 --> 30:06.740
Did anyone force you to stay in our leaky house?

449
30:07.660 --> 30:08.540
That's enough, brother!

450
30:09.380 --> 30:10.140
Serves you right!

451
30:10.140 --> 30:10.460
Brother!

452
30:10.540 --> 30:11.180
How dare you speak to me like that!

453
30:11.180 --> 30:12.180
- I... I'll say what I want! - Brother!

454
30:12.180 --> 30:12.620
What's wrong with that?

455
30:12.740 --> 30:13.060
Brother!

456
30:13.260 --> 30:14.580
- Stop it, brother! - (You!)

457
30:20.500 --> 30:20.940
Don't hurt him!

458
30:24.820 --> 30:25.300
Move aside!

459
30:25.700 --> 30:26.900
My brother hasn't done anything wrong!

460
30:27.340 --> 30:28.300
Why do you look ready to kill him?

461
30:28.940 --> 30:30.220
Who said I was going to kill your brother?

462
30:31.100 --> 30:32.340
I'm disciplining my own servants!

463
30:37.180 --> 30:38.860
You're going to attack someone over some rouge?

464
30:39.260 --> 30:39.860
Is a servant's life

465
30:39.860 --> 30:41.380
worth less than a few pots of rouge?

466
30:41.820 --> 30:42.540
I said, get out of my way!

467
30:42.860 --> 30:43.500
Don't you understand?

468
30:47.740 --> 30:48.100
No!

469
30:57.460 --> 30:59.220
Thank you, my lady! Thank you for sparing me!

470
30:59.700 --> 31:00.580
I entrusted that chest

471
31:01.180 --> 31:02.180
to you for safekeeping.

472
31:03.780 --> 31:04.620
Now that you've messed up,

473
31:05.580 --> 31:06.980
you think you can pin it on the Yans

474
31:07.540 --> 31:08.420
and I'll let you off?

475
31:09.940 --> 31:11.020
You bunch of fools!

476
31:11.460 --> 31:12.580
Do you take me for an idiot too?

477
31:12.700 --> 31:13.700
Forgive us, my lady!

478
31:13.700 --> 31:15.060
It was our fault!

479
31:15.060 --> 31:16.420
We were careless!

480
31:18.860 --> 31:19.700
Everyone responsible for this

481
31:20.420 --> 31:21.740
report to Fang Tong for a whipping.

482
31:27.780 --> 31:28.620
I thought you were going to...

483
31:30.300 --> 31:31.700
You thought I was a spoiled tyrant

484
31:31.980 --> 31:32.820
who kills people on a whim?

485
31:39.300 --> 31:39.780
You're right.

486
31:41.180 --> 31:42.180
That's exactly the kind of person I am.

487
32:02.060 --> 32:02.660
My lady.

488
32:43.780 --> 32:44.340
I don't need your help.

489
32:44.900 --> 32:46.340
Rain can come out of nowhere this time of year.

490
32:46.900 --> 32:47.740
I'll get an umbrella, then.

491
33:04.420 --> 33:04.820
Miss.

492
33:05.460 --> 33:07.060
Was that rouge very expensive?

493
33:08.900 --> 33:09.620
It's not about the money.

494
33:09.820 --> 33:10.500
It was precious to her.

495
33:11.220 --> 33:11.660
You wouldn't understand.

496
33:13.100 --> 33:13.460
You're right.

497
33:15.300 --> 33:16.820
I really don't understand what happened this morning.

498
33:17.540 --> 33:18.700
Could you help me make sense of it?

499
33:19.340 --> 33:20.020
That rouge...

500
33:20.380 --> 33:21.860
She takes it everywhere she goes.

501
33:22.340 --> 33:23.220
She can barely bring herself to use it.

502
33:23.700 --> 33:24.540
And now it's all ruined.

503
33:24.900 --> 33:25.980
You men would never understand.

504
33:32.820 --> 33:33.660
Is that all there is to it?

505
33:37.380 --> 33:38.460
The rest is none of your business.

506
33:45.020 --> 33:46.740
You'd better hurry and apologize to my lady.

507
33:47.020 --> 33:48.300
She's really furious today.

508
33:51.500 --> 33:52.460
Thank you for the advice.

509
33:53.060 --> 33:54.940
But she's still angry now.

510
33:56.100 --> 33:57.780
Perhaps I should prepare a generous gift by way of apology

511
33:58.180 --> 33:59.820
and present it when she leaves,

512
34:00.180 --> 34:00.980
as a farewell gift too.

513
34:01.500 --> 34:02.180
I just wonder...

514
34:02.780 --> 34:03.980
When is she planning to leave?

515
34:06.260 --> 34:06.780
Well...

516
34:08.100 --> 34:08.980
I'll ask her for you.

517
34:09.460 --> 34:09.900
Thank you.

518
34:11.020 --> 34:11.420
Yan Shang!

519
34:12.100 --> 34:12.980
Listen carefully!

520
34:13.980 --> 34:15.340
I love traveling far from home,

521
34:15.900 --> 34:17.180
and I love staying in your shabby house!

522
34:17.580 --> 34:18.940
I'll stay as long as I please!

523
34:20.100 --> 34:21.260
Cross me again,

524
34:21.740 --> 34:23.380
and you'll get far worse than a slap!

525
34:24.540 --> 34:25.340
I might even

526
34:25.860 --> 34:27.300
tear your entire house to the ground.

527
34:29.780 --> 34:30.620
Bring me another jar of wine.

528
34:44.380 --> 34:45.300
After all that,

529
34:45.620 --> 34:47.420
I doubt she'll leave that easily now.

530
34:48.620 --> 34:49.780
With a temper like hers,

531
34:49.980 --> 34:50.940
if she stays much longer,

532
34:51.300 --> 34:52.620
there could be serious trouble.

533
34:54.580 --> 34:56.060
Just who is this woman?

534
35:03.140 --> 35:03.580
Xiaozhou.

535
35:04.180 --> 35:05.100
I need to get to the local school.

536
35:05.580 --> 35:06.340
Our brother can be rather careless.

537
35:06.900 --> 35:08.420
Please keep a close eye on things at home.

538
35:09.100 --> 35:09.420
Sure.

539
35:18.220 --> 35:21.180
(Diligent Study, Steadfast Practice) A gentleman follows the Way,

540
35:22.020 --> 35:23.780
but may give up halfway.

541
35:24.740 --> 35:27.260
I could never bring myself to stop.

542
35:28.140 --> 35:30.620
A gentleman holds fast to the Middle Way.

543
35:31.460 --> 35:34.580
Though he lives in obscurity,

544
35:34.980 --> 35:36.420
he has no regrets.

545
35:37.060 --> 35:40.220
Only a sage can achieve this.

546
35:42.540 --> 35:43.260
In my opinion,

547
35:43.860 --> 35:45.193
(Learning without thought is labor lost; thought without learning is perilous.)

548
35:45.194 --> 35:45.740
Whether the Way prevails or not,

549
35:46.260 --> 35:47.740
a man born into this world should

550
35:48.060 --> 35:48.860
serve the people and keep the peace,

551
35:49.020 --> 35:50.020
be loyal to his ruler and country.

552
35:50.500 --> 35:51.420
That is what a true man should do.

553
35:51.580 --> 35:53.060
And you, Shang?

554
35:53.580 --> 35:55.140
What do you think?

555
35:55.540 --> 35:57.580
Master, I have no desire to pursue strange, obscure ways.

556
35:58.060 --> 35:59.220
Nor could I live in seclusion, unknown to the world.

557
36:00.220 --> 36:01.340
Those things feel far beyond me.

558
36:01.820 --> 36:03.060
They're not beyond you.

559
36:03.500 --> 36:06.860
You simply haven't found your own Way yet.

560
36:18.540 --> 36:22.020
♪Moonlight shimmers upon the pond♪

561
36:22.700 --> 36:26.140
♪Riding a bamboo horse past the red pond♪

562
36:26.620 --> 36:30.020
♪The water's too deep to cross♪

563
36:30.460 --> 36:33.900
♪A maiden rows to fetch her love♪

564
36:35.460 --> 36:36.180
(Diligent Study, Steadfast Practice) (Yan Shang, we're off!)

565
36:36.180 --> 36:36.540
(Heading home.)

566
36:36.620 --> 36:37.060
(We'll take our leave.)

567
36:37.060 --> 36:38.460
Yan Shang, have you finished copying my book?

568
36:38.820 --> 36:39.260
All done.

569
36:41.220 --> 36:42.660
Yan Shang, have you finished my policy essay?

570
36:43.100 --> 36:43.900
Take a look and see if it's all right.

571
36:44.420 --> 36:44.860
No need.

572
36:45.140 --> 36:46.260
Everything you ghostwrite is excellent.

573
36:47.100 --> 36:48.220
Here. Your payment.

574
36:48.740 --> 36:49.140
- (Let's go.) - (Go.)

575
36:50.220 --> 36:50.500
(Let's go!)

576
36:50.940 --> 36:51.380
Yan Shang.

577
36:51.700 --> 36:52.500
I have to go now.

578
36:52.780 --> 36:54.300
Mind clearing my desk for me?

579
36:54.500 --> 36:54.780
Sure.

580
36:57.340 --> 36:58.820
Liu Wenji, what'd you hit me for?

581
36:58.980 --> 37:00.500
Shang works for the local school,

582
37:00.660 --> 37:01.620
not for you.

583
37:01.860 --> 37:02.780
You've got plenty of servants at home.

584
37:02.940 --> 37:03.900
Why not have them clean up after you?

585
37:06.460 --> 37:10.340
(Liu Wenji, Son of the Shaozhou Prefect, Yan Shang's Classmate)

586
37:10.980 --> 37:11.380
Wenji.

587
37:12.140 --> 37:12.900
It's no big deal.

588
37:13.180 --> 37:13.900
No need to get upset.

589
37:15.380 --> 37:16.460
(Diligent Study, Steadfast Practice) The more accommodating you are,

590
37:16.660 --> 37:17.980
the more they'll walk all over you.

591
37:19.180 --> 37:19.940
I promise you,

592
37:20.220 --> 37:22.060
even if you beat them all up tomorrow,

593
37:22.620 --> 37:23.140
as long as I'm around,

594
37:23.500 --> 37:25.260
you can still work and study here.

595
37:25.780 --> 37:26.180
All right.

596
37:26.780 --> 37:28.420
Then I'll beat them all up tomorrow.

597
37:30.140 --> 37:31.180
Even without me,

598
37:31.420 --> 37:32.580
they'd never let you leave.

599
37:33.020 --> 37:34.460
What would anyone do without you?

600
37:41.620 --> 37:43.020
Yesterday, I was copying official documents for my father.

601
37:43.300 --> 37:45.820
I read this month's latest copy of the court bulletin.

602
37:48.100 --> 37:49.460
Anything major happening lately?

603
37:49.940 --> 37:50.660
Nothing major.

604
37:51.020 --> 37:52.580
But there was one rather interesting little story.

605
37:54.140 --> 37:55.660
Apparently, Princess Danyang is a devoted daughter.

606
37:55.980 --> 37:58.260
She traveled all the way from Sheng'an to Mount Lufu

607
37:58.380 --> 38:00.340
to pray for the late Empress and perform rites for her soul.

608
38:00.820 --> 38:01.660
By my reckoning,

609
38:02.140 --> 38:03.020
she should be in Lingnan by now.

610
38:03.420 --> 38:05.900
Every prefecture along the route has prepared a grand welcome.

611
38:07.100 --> 38:08.140
After all, she's now

612
38:08.580 --> 38:10.700
His Majesty's only beloved daughter.

613
38:11.580 --> 38:12.580
But guess what?

614
38:13.940 --> 38:14.420
What?

615
38:15.420 --> 38:17.020
Not a single prefecture has seen her.

616
38:18.220 --> 38:19.180
Strange, isn't it?

617
38:22.140 --> 38:23.780
(So she's Princess Danyang.)

618
38:26.820 --> 38:27.780
(Then forgive me, Your Highness.)

619
38:27.780 --> 38:29.020
(Merit Through the Ages)

620
38:29.020 --> 38:30.020
(Our humble home)

621
38:30.620 --> 38:32.340
(is no place for someone of your royal standing.)

622
38:33.220 --> 38:35.020
(And my family can't afford any more trouble.)

623
38:35.020 --> 38:40.980
(Santu County Office)

624
38:40.980 --> 38:41.660
What do you want?

625
38:43.300 --> 38:43.820
Sir,

626
38:44.500 --> 38:46.100
something strange happened to me today.

627
38:46.780 --> 38:47.580
After giving it some thought,

628
38:47.980 --> 38:49.020
I decided I should report it to the magistrate.

629
38:49.580 --> 38:50.580
What's so strange about it?

630
38:51.940 --> 38:53.380
I was passing through Caimei Ridge today

631
38:53.780 --> 38:54.660
when I came across a carriage.

632
38:55.260 --> 38:57.700
There was a lady inside who claimed to be Princess Danyang.

633
38:58.260 --> 38:59.100
(Chen Da, Santu County Bailiff) She'd gotten lost in the mountains

634
38:59.460 --> 39:00.260
and was looking for someone from the prefectural office.

635
39:00.780 --> 39:02.180
(Merit Through the Ages)

636
39:02.180 --> 39:03.020
Princess Danyang?

637
39:03.660 --> 39:04.620
Are you sure you heard that right?

638
39:06.420 --> 39:07.740
I think that's what I heard.

639
39:08.700 --> 39:09.420
(Zhang Renjing, Captain of the Shence Army)

640
39:09.420 --> 39:09.980
This journey

641
39:11.540 --> 39:12.460
has completely worn me out.

642
39:14.940 --> 39:16.180
I'm lucky you've taken such good care of me.

643
39:17.060 --> 39:18.540
Oh, think nothing of it!

644
39:19.020 --> 39:20.420
Once you arrive in Sheng'an, Captain,

645
39:20.780 --> 39:22.260
and catch Lord Yu's eye,

646
39:22.540 --> 39:25.060
you'll have a brilliant career ahead of you!

647
39:25.500 --> 39:26.860
Oh, I wouldn't count on that.

648
39:27.980 --> 39:29.900
Lord Yu is a man of great stature!

649
39:30.540 --> 39:31.660
(Zheng Chengqing, County Magistrate) If he even recognizes me,

650
39:31.980 --> 39:33.740
I'd consider myself blessed beyond belief.

651
39:34.300 --> 39:35.380
You're too modest, Captain.

652
39:41.340 --> 39:42.060
What do you think you're doing?

653
39:42.100 --> 39:42.980
Can't you see the captain's here?

654
39:43.660 --> 39:46.220
I've found a lead on Princess Danyang's whereabouts.

655
39:47.940 --> 39:48.580
Are you certain?

656
39:49.060 --> 39:50.020
Absolutely certain!

657
39:50.300 --> 39:52.060
Someone spotted her at Caimei Ridge!

658
39:53.180 --> 39:53.580
Your Honor,

659
39:54.260 --> 39:55.980
once you find the princess tomorrow,

660
39:56.300 --> 39:58.300
invite her to stay at our county office.

661
39:58.860 --> 40:00.820
Then the prefect himself will surely pay us a visit!

662
40:02.940 --> 40:04.420
Gather a troop of men at once.

663
40:04.580 --> 40:05.340
Prepare some lavish gifts.

664
40:05.660 --> 40:07.300
I'll pay my respects to Her Highness myself tomorrow.

665
40:07.540 --> 40:07.980
Yes, sir! Right away!

666
40:10.500 --> 40:11.380
Come, Captain. Another drink!

667
40:11.940 --> 40:12.780
No more, no more.

668
40:13.460 --> 40:14.180
I should get going.

669
40:14.780 --> 40:16.020
Can't afford to fall behind schedule.

670
40:16.620 --> 40:17.100
Of course, of course!

671
40:17.500 --> 40:18.340
Watch your step.

672
40:18.340 --> 40:18.860
All right, all right.

673
40:19.780 --> 40:20.260
No need to see me out.

674
40:20.740 --> 40:21.180
Okay.

675
40:21.180 --> 40:21.860
No need to come any farther.

676
40:56.020 --> 40:58.020
(Santu County Office Merit Through the Ages)

677
41:10.340 --> 41:12.340
(Santu County Office)

678
41:16.140 --> 41:17.220
Out of my way!

679
41:19.660 --> 41:19.980
(Santu County Office) Get lost!

680
41:30.340 --> 41:31.980
(Santu County Office)

681
41:33.500 --> 41:33.780
Go!

682
41:38.220 --> 41:40.300
(Merit Through the Ages)

683
41:48.700 --> 41:49.580
(It's him.)

684
41:53.140 --> 41:55.300
(He's actually still alive.)

685
42:00.100 --> 42:04.740
(Next Episode Preview)

686
42:04.980 --> 42:05.740
I want to get out of here.

687
42:06.140 --> 42:07.020
She's an honored guest from Sheng'an.

688
42:07.020 --> 42:08.220
She could give me that chance.

689
42:08.460 --> 42:09.860
You think groveling at her feet

690
42:09.860 --> 42:11.060
will send you soaring through the ranks?

691
42:11.500 --> 42:12.580
Better than living like you,

692
42:12.860 --> 42:14.540
hiding in this wretched backwater your whole life,

693
42:14.540 --> 42:15.980
shutting out the world like a coward!

694
42:16.340 --> 42:17.700
Have you no shame?

695
42:21.120 --> 42:24.413
♪Be the ferry where you wait for the sun♪

696
42:27.098 --> 42:32.014
♪Be the blue silk that catches your tears♪

697
42:34.208 --> 42:40.053
♪Be the sleeve we held, worn by dust and years♪

698
42:40.553 --> 42:45.779
♪Let's conspire to grow old together♪

699
42:48.548 --> 42:53.339
♪Let me be a captive beast bound by the same lock as you♪

700
42:54.175 --> 43:00.254
♪Through trails of mud and blood; let grief drown in your eyes♪

701
43:02.055 --> 43:05.205
♪Soar with the wind; plunge into hellfire as one♪

702
43:05.205 --> 43:06.853
♪Burning bright as a song♪

703
43:06.905 --> 43:10.629
♪See how roses and green bamboo enchant♪

704
43:11.007 --> 43:15.673
♪Be the vow I make with all my heart♪

705
43:16.292 --> 43:20.333
♪If we say forever, then forever it shall be♪

706
43:20.824 --> 43:22.939
♪Not a single hour less♪

707
43:22.979 --> 43:29.925
♪However deep the snow, I'll wait if you're there♪

708
43:30.688 --> 43:34.141
♪We'll be gods above, or wandering souls♪

709
43:34.321 --> 43:37.466
♪In heaven or the underworld, you're all I need♪

710
43:37.905 --> 43:44.542
♪If we can stay, let's return to the village of our first meeting♪

711
43:44.939 --> 43:49.453
♪May time be free of fear and pain; boats rock, lights fade, seasons turn♪

712
43:49.491 --> 43:51.960
♪You're the only one I need♪

713
43:52.164 --> 43:59.051
♪Sharp winds or fierce rain, nothing can break us♪

714
43:59.363 --> 44:02.634
♪Be mine in this world; be mine in this life♪

715
44:02.939 --> 44:06.112
♪My last untouched innocence♪

716
44:06.436 --> 44:09.862
♪If only we could return to the village where we first met♪

717
44:10.095 --> 44:13.320
♪Stay by me; help me forget the frozen dream of last night♪

718
44:13.651 --> 44:20.447
♪Fireflies glow, flowers kiss our lips; just us, through dawn and dusk♪

719
44:20.816 --> 44:25.382
♪May time be free of fear and pain; boats rock, lights fade, seasons turn♪

720
44:25.429 --> 44:27.767
♪You're the only one I need♪

721
44:27.998 --> 44:34.833
♪By your side, through joy and pain, is that eternity?♪

722
44:35.182 --> 44:36.800
♪Till fireworks flood the town♪

723
44:36.930 --> 44:38.726
♪Till the lake is still and clear♪

724
44:39.083 --> 44:42.100
♪You're the only one I need♪

725
44:42.140 --> 44:43.467
(No animals were harmed or mistreated in production.)
